                                "sense_id": "a8b40141-3d4b-34c4-9c95-0e64be123300",
                                "text": "The chilled beer was refreshing on the hot day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86b929c7-c9a8-47a3-b0f1-b06c57fcd4f5",
                                "sense_id": "a8b40141-3d4b-34c4-9c95-0e64be123300",
                                "text": "In the northern hemisphere, June 21 has the most daylight hours. Pack a picnic—a chilled bottle of Sancerre, cheese, olives, and a nice baguette—and hit the grassy knoll."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a301ae51-4475-3dbf-9b6d-6b489353ed31",
